  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Dondante** (2 reviews): Listener exclaims Dondante is amazing and praises the overall sound quality; Listener notes Dondante performed exceptionally well on this specific date [6][9]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **November 2021 (Friday)**: rare: 3 archived performances [10]\n- **Magic Bullet**: rare: 7 archived performances [10]\n- **Complex**: rare: 6 archived performances [10]\n- **If All Else Fails**: rare: 5 archived performances [10]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2021-11-05.leary** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 142 min; rated 4.88/5 by 8 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bedouine opened the show, which was the second of a three-night stand [1]\n- Attendees were required to show proof of vaccination to enter the venue [1]\n- Listener claims the vinyl release sounds significantly better than this audience recording [9]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2021-11-05.leary**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]",
